            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Trusted Landscaping Tools and Garden Equipment Supplier in Glenwood Springs, CO Since 1989",
            "text": "<p>Cutting through dry branches or trimming overgrown bushes can be frustrating without the right tools. That’s why Rivendell Distribution carries pruning tools that make quick work of yard cleanup, tree shaping, and brush control here in Glenwood Springs, CO.</p><p>You’ll find<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Pruners\" target=\"_blank\"> hand pruners</a> for small branches,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Loppers\" target=\"_blank\"> loppers</a> for thicker cuts,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hedge+Shears\" target=\"_blank\"> hedge shears</a> for trimming shrubs, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Tree+Pruners\" target=\"_blank\"> tree pruners</a> built for reach. For tougher jobs, we also stock machetes, hand saws, and striking tools that are made to handle Colorado’s dense wood and uneven ground. We’ve got what you need to keep your garden, trees, and property clean and under control.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
